{"id":"33e207bac16abe1a","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence.md","title":"PDA–CFG Language Equivalence","display":"thm-pda-cfg-equivalence — PDA–CFG Language Equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence","aliases":["73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence","73-thm-pda-cfg-equivalence"],"display":"thm-pda-cfg-equivalence — PDA–CFG Language Equivalence","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","[[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence</span><span>73-thm-pda-cfg-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pda-cfg-equivalence — PDA–CFG Language Equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_F(M)\">\\(L_F(M)\\)</span> (PDAs and final-state languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a4359425e2c64d0a\" href=\"?note=a4359425e2c64d0a\" title=\"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics\">73-df-pda-final-state-semantics</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(\nL\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L_F(M))\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(\nL\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L_F(M))\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>From a CFG, a PDA nondeterministically expands the top nonterminal or matches a terminal with the next input symbol.</li>\n<li>From a PDA, variables indexed by pairs of states generate exactly the words that carry the machine between those states while balancing the relevant stack segment. Induction on derivations/runs proves both inclusions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；字母与有限词的类型见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$ (context-free languages, see [[73-df-cfg-language-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-pda-final-state-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"a4359425e2c64d0a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L_F(M)$ (PDAs and final-state languages, see [[73-df-pda-final-state-semantics]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"L_F(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pda\\text{-}cfg\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\forall L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\left(\nL\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists M\\in\\mathsf{PDA}_{\\Sigma}\\;(L=L_F(M))\n\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1396,"backlinks":[{"id":"d98c56ef00c67ca3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"811f42d3d6662f09","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["83639a9615c06195","a4359425e2c64d0a","0a6da8c909717780"]}